{"slug":"define-a-function","title":"LISP练习——定义一个函数，接受一个列表并返回一个列表，指出相等元素出现的次数，并由最常见至最少见的排序","date":"2019-09-09","tags":["Lisp"],"category":"Expand Learning","excerpt":"LISP函数练习","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1,"contentHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p>LISP函数练习</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"要点\">要点</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>cons</code>构造列表，构造的结果是包含<code>car</code>与<code>cdr</code>的组合对象</li>\n<li><code>mapcar</code>对列表的每一项进行一种操作</li>\n<li><code>sort</code> 使用自定义的比较方法进行排序</li>\n<li>递归遍历列表</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"cons的使用\"><code>cons</code>的使用</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(cons 'a 'b)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; Expected: (A . B)</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">lisp</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"mapcar的使用\"><code>mapcar</code>的使用</h3>\n<p>将列表中每个数字都乘2</p>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(mapcar #'(lambda (e) (if (numberp e) (* e 2) e)) '(1 a 2 b 3 c))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; Expected: (2 A 4 B 6 C)</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">lisp</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"sort-使用\"><code>sort</code> 使用</h3>\n<p>将数字元素放在前，其他元素放在后面，并将数字按照从小到大排序</p>\n<h3 id=\"sort-lisp\">sort-lisp</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(defun my-sort (l)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (sort l #'(lambda (e1 e2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (if (numberp e1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (if (numberp e2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          (&#x3C; e1 e2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          T)))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(format t \"~A ~%\" (my-sort '(8 z 6 a 2 i 3 (1 8) (j k) 5)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; Expected: (2 3 5 6 8 Z A I (1 8) (J K))</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">lisp</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"复合使用\">复合使用</h3>\n<h3 id=\"combine-lisp\">combine-lisp</h3>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>;;; 统计在列表中，每个字母出现的次数，并将结果按照出现次数由大到小排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(defun occurrences (l)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (if (null l) ; 若为nil，返回 nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (let (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (r (occurrences (cdr l))) ; 递归求值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (alpha (car l)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      (sort (if (null r) ; 对结果排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          (cons (cons (car l) 1) r) ; 若结果为nil，则说明是第一次遇到字母，直接放入空表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          (if (every #'(lambda (item) (not (eql (car item) alpha))) r) ; 当前的字母在表中是否没有记录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            (cons (cons (car l) 1) r) ; 没有记录直接放入记录中，次数为 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            (mapcar ; 有记录，在原来基础上 + 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              #'(lambda (item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                (if (eql (car item) alpha)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  (cons alpha (+ (cdr item) 1))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                  item))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>              r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ))) #'(lambda (item1 item2) (> (cdr item1) (cdr item2)))))))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(format t \"~A\" (occurrences '(a b a d a c d c a)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>; Expected: ((A . 4) (C . 2) (D . 2) (B . 1))</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">lisp</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>","related":[{"slug":"special-data-type-practice","title":"LISP 学习——特殊数据类型的操作练习","date":"2019-11-16","tags":["Lisp"],"category":"Expand Learning","excerpt":"LISP数据类型学习","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"lisp-basic-practice","title":"LISP基础练习","date":"2019-10-01","tags":["Lisp"],"category":"Expand Learning","excerpt":"LISP基础练习","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"find-a-times-in-list","title":"LISP练习——找到\"a\"在列表中出现的次数","date":"2020-06-12","tags":["Lisp"],"category":"Expand Learning","excerpt":"在LISP中用循环以及递归两种方式实现：找到a在列表中出现的次数","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1}]}